  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞３Ｆ，“占卜馆”前……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞与伊丽莎白交谈后，\n　她请来了玛格丽特……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 23 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}让您久等了。\n姐姐登场了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}提出这么奇怪的委托，真不好意思。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}我想四处逛逛，放松一下，\n不过这种类似现实世界的地方，\n我实在不太熟悉。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 09 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}姐姐。\n那您就不必担心了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:3:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 04 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}这位可是罕见的导游高手……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:3:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}一定能领会我们话语中的深意，\n巧妙地让我们放松下来。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 23 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}是吗……那就交给您了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}您有多让我们满意，\n我们就准备多少额外报酬。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……感受到了两人热切的期待。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 07 01}那么，导览……开幕！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e802_320.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞……总之，先去摊位街\n　随意逛逛吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
]